// For the logic to account for all skips, these rules would need to be made much more comprehensive

// Researchsanity Items
Can Research All Items;             ResearchItem | Item;                                // This one is present if totalChecksThere is <4.
Can Research Stackable Items;       ResearchItem | Item;                                // This one is present if totalChecksThere is between 4-17 (inclusive).
Can Research 1-To-Research Accessories; ResearchItem | Item;                            // The 1-To-Research ones are present if totalChecksThere is >=4.
1_Research_Acc;                     ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research 1-To-Research Accessories;
Can Research 1-To-Research Weapons; ResearchItem | Item;
1_Research_Wep;                     ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research 1-To-Research Weapons;
Can Research 1-To-Research Other Items; ResearchItem | Item;
1_Research_Oth;                     ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research 1-To-Research Other Items;
Can Research 2-To-Research Items;   ResearchItem | Item;                                // The rest are only present if totalChecksThere is >=18.
2_Research;                         ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research Stackable Items | Can Research 2-To-Research Items;
Can Research 3-To-Research Items;   ResearchItem | Item;
3_Research;                         ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research Stackable Items | Can Research 3-To-Research Items;
Can Research 5-To-Research Items;   ResearchItem | Item;
5_Research;                         ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research Stackable Items | Can Research 5-To-Research Items;
Can Research 10-To-Research Items;  ResearchItem | Item;
10_Research;                        ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research Stackable Items | Can Research 10-To-Research Items;
Can Research 15-To-Research Items;  ResearchItem | Item;
15_Research;                        ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research Stackable Items | Can Research 15-To-Research Items;
Can Research 20-To-Research Items;  ResearchItem | Item;
20_Research;                        ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research Stackable Items | Can Research 20-To-Research Items;
Can Research 25-To-Research Items;  ResearchItem | Item;
25_Research;                        ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research Stackable Items | Can Research 25-To-Research Items;
Can Research 30-To-Research Items;  ResearchItem | Item;
30_Research;                        ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research Stackable Items | Can Research 30-To-Research Items;
Can Research 50-To-Research Items;  ResearchItem | Item;
50_Research;                        ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research Stackable Items | Can Research 50-To-Research Items;
Can Research 99-To-Research Items;  ResearchItem | Item;
99_Research;                        ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research Stackable Items | Can Research 99-To-Research Items;
Can Research 100-To-Research Non-Tile Items; ResearchItem | Item;
100_Research_NTl;                   ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research Stackable Items | Can Research 100-To-Research Non-Tile Items;
Can Research 100-To-Research Tiles; ResearchItem | Item;
100_Research_Til;                   ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research Stackable Items | Can Research 100-To-Research Tiles;
Can Research 200-To-Research Items; ResearchItem | Item;
200_Research;                       ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research Stackable Items | Can Research 200-To-Research Items;
Can Research 400-To-Research Items; ResearchItem | Item;
400_Research;                       ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research Stackable Items | Can Research 400-To-Research Items;
Can Research Miscellaneous-Count Items; ResearchItem | Item;
Misc_Research;                      ResearchGroup;                              ~@research_items | Can Research All Items | Can Research Stackable Items | Can Research Miscellaneous-Count Items;

